<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets call warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets call warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Vontobel &amp; Co said it has issued five million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Nestle SA.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,625 CHF		 PREMIUM	8.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.70 CHF		  GEARING	18.8 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 21.FEB.97-06.FEB.98   PAYDATE	21.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     SPOT REF     1,570 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
